<Cell title="agent-html">
  <Section width="content">
    <Stack>
      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h1">agent-html</Text>
          <Text variant="lead">面向 Agent 的受约束 UI 语言与实时编辑界面：悬停任意显式块、拖拽把手、打开加号输入框，再从顶部切换主题。</Text>
        </Stack>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h3">柱状图</Text>
          <Text variant="muted">同一个界面在不同创作方式下的 token 成本对比。</Text>
          <Chart type="bar">
            <ChartSeries key="ahtml" label="AHTML" />
            <ChartSeries key="html" label="HTML" />
            <ChartSeries key="react" label="React" />
            <ChartRow label="源码 token" ahtml="3600" html="19871" react="4041" />
            <ChartTooltip hideLabel="false" />
          </Chart>
        </Stack>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h3">趋势图</Text>
          <Text variant="muted">随着界面结构变复杂，agent-html 更贴近组件意图。</Text>
          <Chart type="area">
            <ChartSeries key="ahtml" label="AHTML" />
            <ChartSeries key="react" label="React" />
            <ChartRow label="首屏" ahtml="24" react="58" />
            <ChartRow label="卡片" ahtml="38" react="96" />
            <ChartRow label="流程" ahtml="51" react="138" />
            <ChartRow label="展示页" ahtml="69" react="188" />
            <ChartTooltip hideLabel="false" />
          </Chart>
        </Stack>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h2">体验编辑界面</Text>
          <Text variant="muted">这个预览不是静态页面。直接在页面里操作，感受 agent-html 如何把显式块变成类似 Notion 的协作单元。</Text>
        </Stack>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Kanban>
          <KanbanColumn value="discover" title="发现">
            <KanbanItem value="hover-handle">
              <Stack>
                <Text variant="small">悬停任意显式块，直到左侧控制按钮渐显。</Text>
                <Badge variant="secondary">块把手</Badge>
              </Stack>
            </KanbanItem>
            <KanbanItem value="drag-block">
              <Stack>
                <Text variant="small">抓住六点把手，把块移动到上方、下方，或拖进列布局。</Text>
                <Badge variant="outline">拖拽排序</Badge>
              </Stack>
            </KanbanItem>
          </KanbanColumn>
          <KanbanColumn value="create" title="创建">
            <KanbanItem value="open-plus">
              <Stack>
                <Text variant="small">点击把手上方的加号，打开块级输入区。</Text>
                <Badge variant="secondary">加号入口</Badge>
              </Stack>
            </KanbanItem>
            <KanbanItem value="ask-chat">
              <Stack>
                <Text variant="small">把输入区作为未来 Ask、Search 或 Chat 的 AI 编辑入口。</Text>
                <Badge variant="outline">AI 界面</Badge>
              </Stack>
            </KanbanItem>
          </KanbanColumn>
          <KanbanColumn value="personalize" title="个性化">
            <KanbanItem value="switch-theme">
              <Stack>
                <Text variant="small">打开顶部 Theme 菜单，不改源码也能切换调色板。</Text>
                <Badge variant="secondary">主题切换</Badge>
              </Stack>
            </KanbanItem>
            <KanbanItem value="shared-tokens">
              <Stack>
                <Text variant="small">图表、表格、提示框和块高亮都消费同一套 runtime token。</Text>
                <Badge variant="outline">Token 驱动</Badge>
              </Stack>
            </KanbanItem>
          </KanbanColumn>
        </Kanban>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h2">小源码，真组件</Text>
          <Text variant="muted">Agent 编写的是紧凑的树结构。runtime 会在验证后把它渲染成真实 UI primitives。</Text>
          <CodeBlock language="ahtml" title="一个小型创作界面">
<Cell title="Demo">
  <Stack>
    <Block>
      <Section width="reader">
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="lead">用受约束标签描述界面。</Text>
          <Badge variant="secondary">渲染前完成验证</Badge>
        </Stack>
      </Section>
    </Block>
  </Stack>
</Cell>
          </CodeBlock>
        </Stack>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Alert>
          <Icon name="shield-check" />
          <AlertTitle>渲染前先验证</AlertTitle>
          <AlertDescription>未知标签、非法属性、不安全图标和不支持的子结构都会在进入预览界面前失败。</AlertDescription>
        </Alert>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h2">Runtime 流水线</Text>
          <Text variant="muted">边界很明确：源码进入解析器，AST 经过验证，再由 runtime 组件渲染结果。</Text>
          <Timeline>
            <TimelineItem icon="code-xml" meta="创作" status="complete">
              <TimelineTitle>受约束标记语言</TimelineTitle>
              <TimelineDescription>Agent 编写嵌套标签、引号属性和插槽，而不是 class 名。</TimelineDescription>
              <TimelineContent>
                <Cluster wrap="true">
                  <Badge variant="secondary">Cell</Badge>
                  <Badge variant="outline">Grid</Badge>
                  <Badge variant="outline">Text</Badge>
                </Cluster>
              </TimelineContent>
            </TimelineItem>
            <TimelineItem icon="shield-check" meta="验证" status="current">
              <TimelineTitle>渲染前检查 AST</TimelineTitle>
              <TimelineDescription>非法结构会在 UI 出现前失败。</TimelineDescription>
              <TimelineContent>
                <Cluster wrap="true">
                  <Badge variant="secondary">标签</Badge>
                  <Badge variant="outline">属性</Badge>
                  <Badge variant="outline">子节点</Badge>
                </Cluster>
              </TimelineContent>
            </TimelineItem>
            <TimelineItem icon="component" meta="运行时" status="default">
              <TimelineTitle>生产级 primitives</TimelineTitle>
              <TimelineDescription>渲染结果使用与产品一致的组件系统。</TimelineDescription>
            </TimelineItem>
          </Timeline>
        </Stack>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h2">可组合组件生态</Text>
          <Text variant="muted">表格、媒体、提示框、徽章、图表、时间线、标签页和折叠面板共享同一个受约束创作界面。</Text>
          <Text variant="h3">表格</Text>
          <Table>
            <TableCaption>同一个界面，不同创作方式</TableCaption>
            <TableHeader>
              <TableRow>
                <TableHead>格式</TableHead>
                <TableHead>优势</TableHead>
                <TableHead>代价</TableHead>
              </TableRow>
            </TableHeader>
            <TableBody>
              <TableRow>
                <TableCell>AHTML</TableCell>
                <TableCell>结构紧凑</TableCell>
                <TableCell>需要 runtime</TableCell>
              </TableRow>
              <TableRow>
                <TableCell>HTML</TableCell>
                <TableCell>通用输出</TableCell>
                <TableCell>丢失组件意图</TableCell>
              </TableRow>
              <TableRow>
                <TableCell>React</TableCell>
                <TableCell>完全控制</TableCell>
                <TableCell>token 成本最高</TableCell>
              </TableRow>
            </TableBody>
          </Table>
        </Stack>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h3">宽高比</Text>
          <Text variant="muted">媒体内容在生成布局中保持稳定尺寸。</Text>
          <AspectRatio ratio="1.777">
            <Image src="/assets/blocks.png" alt="Agent HTML 块预览" fit="cover" />
          </AspectRatio>
        </Stack>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h3">Runtime 契约</Text>
          <Alert>
            <Icon name="route" />
            <AlertTitle>只消费公开表面</AlertTitle>
            <AlertDescription>demo 只通过 runtime contract 工作，不触碰应用内部实现。</AlertDescription>
          </Alert>
          <Cluster wrap="true">
            <Badge variant="secondary">解析器</Badge>
            <Badge variant="outline">验证器</Badge>
            <Badge variant="outline">渲染器</Badge>
          </Cluster>
        </Stack>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h2">Runtime 交互 primitives</Text>
          <Text variant="muted">Accordion 和 Tabs 保持声明式，交互行为由 runtime 提供。</Text>
          <Text variant="h3">折叠面板</Text>
          <Accordion type="single">
            <AccordionItem value="html-shape">
              <AccordionTrigger>为什么是 HTML 形态？</AccordionTrigger>
              <AccordionContent>
                <Stack>
                  <Badge variant="secondary">降低模型摩擦</Badge>
                  <Text variant="small">LLM 已经理解嵌套标记、属性和闭合标签。</Text>
                </Stack>
              </AccordionContent>
            </AccordionItem>
            <AccordionItem value="narrow-props">
              <AccordionTrigger>为什么限制 props？</AccordionTrigger>
              <AccordionContent>
                <Stack>
                  <Badge variant="outline">可靠生成优先于无限灵活</Badge>
                  <Text variant="small">小型 variant 集合让生成 UI 更容易验证和比较。</Text>
                </Stack>
              </AccordionContent>
            </AccordionItem>
            <AccordionItem value="runtime">
              <AccordionTrigger>为什么使用 runtime primitives？</AccordionTrigger>
              <AccordionContent>
                <Stack>
                  <Badge variant="secondary">不做第二套 UI kit</Badge>
                  <Text variant="small">DSL 组合生产 primitives，而不是重新发明一套组件系统。</Text>
                </Stack>
              </AccordionContent>
            </AccordionItem>
          </Accordion>
        </Stack>
      </Block>

      <Block>
        <Stack>
          <Text variant="h3">标签页</Text>
          <Tabs defaultValue="author">
            <TabsList>
              <TabsTrigger value="author">创作</TabsTrigger>
              <TabsTrigger value="validate">验证</TabsTrigger>
              <TabsTrigger value="render">渲染</TabsTrigger>
            </TabsList>
            <TabsContent value="author">
              <Stack>
                <Badge variant="secondary">XML 形态</Badge>
                <Text variant="small">编写能直接映射到 runtime primitives 的标签和属性。</Text>
              </Stack>
            </TabsContent>
            <TabsContent value="validate">
              <Stack>
                <Badge variant="outline">Schema 检查</Badge>
                <Text variant="small">在源码进入预览界面前阻断非法结构。</Text>
              </Stack>
            </TabsContent>
            <TabsContent value="render">
              <Stack>
                <Badge variant="secondary">Runtime 支撑</Badge>
                <Text variant="small">通过 shadcn primitives 渲染，并复用共享主题 token。</Text>
              </Stack>
            </TabsContent>
          </Tabs>
        </Stack>
      </Block>
    </Stack>
  </Section>
</Cell>
